[LevelInfo0]
; EN: Title="Glacier"
Title="Glacier"

[LevelSummary]
; EN: Title="Glacier"
Title="Glacier"
; EN: Description="In one of the most daring acts of the mostly covert Corporation Wars, Izanagi Corporation's research facility on Lamdon 3 was raided and destroyed by a strike force from the Axon Research Corporation, despite the protection offered by the elite NEG ThunderCrash force.  This scenario recreates that mission.  Axon was able to not only destroy the facility, but also retrieve the advanced plasma ion tank under development there.  You must infiltrate the facility, steal the plasma ion tank, and destroy the entire facility."
Description="In one of the most daring acts of the mostly covert Corporation Wars, Izanagi Corporation's research facility on Lamdon 3 was raided and destroyed by a strike force from the Axon Research Corporation, despite the protection offered by the elite NEG ThunderCrash force.  This scenario recreates that mission.  Axon was able to not only destroy the facility, but also retrieve the advanced plasma ion tank under development there.  You must infiltrate the facility, steal the plasma ion tank, and destroy the entire facility."

